  "mu_name": "Destroy Armor",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain's MODEL_DESTORY_* (_enum.h: MODEL_ARMOR + 47), loaded from Data/Player/ArmorMale48.bmd by the index-plus-one rule. MU's number 47; ours is *Male48. OpenMU spells the armour, pants and boots 'Destory' (MU's MODEL_DESTORY_*), the gloves 'Destroy'; ours is Destroy throughout.",
